# Empower Jace with several Jace planeswalker tokens under your control: "you'll choose one of those tokens to put the loyalty
# counters on". Bot1 empowers on turn 1 (a Jace token with 2 loyalty). Bot2 casts Jace, the Mind Sculptor on turn 2, and on turn 3
# Bot1's Fractured Identity exiles it and gives Bot1 a token copy that keeps the printed 3 loyalty - a second Jace planeswalker
# token. On turn 5 the empower asks which token; Bot1 picks the first one, which goes to 4, and the copy stays at 3. (The second
# Sanctum beholds the first token on turn 3, so it is untapped and pays for the spell.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Theorist's Sanctum
Theorist's Sanctum
Black Lotus
Jace, the Mind Sculptor
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Fractured Identity
Mox Jet
Island
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Jace, the Mind Sculptor
Island x3
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Theorist's Sanctum.Play
Bot1.Choose(Jace, the Mind Sculptor)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Theorist's Sanctum.Activate(Ability: Empower)
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Jace, the Mind Sculptor.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Jace, the Mind Sculptor.Counters.Loyalty = 3
Bot1.Hand.Theorist's Sanctum.Play
Bot1.Choose(Jace Token)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Theorist's Sanctum#1.Activate(Ability: Add)
Bot1.Battlefield.Theorist's Sanctum#2.Activate(Ability: Add)
Bot1.Hand.Fractured Identity.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Jace, the Mind Sculptor)
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Jace, the Mind Sculptor.Counters.Loyalty = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Theorist's Sanctum#1.Activate(Ability: Empower)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Jace Token)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Counters.Loyalty = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace, the Mind Sculptor.Counters.Loyalty = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace, the Mind Sculptor.Token = true
Exile = Jace, the Mind Sculptor
